#: data/org.gnome.Weather.desktop.in.in:13
msgid "Allows weather information to be displayed for your location."
msgstr ""
"Omena lalana ny hisehoan'ny momban'ny toetr'andro amin'ny faritra misy anao."

#: data/org.gnome.Weather.gschema.xml:6
msgid "Configured cities to show weather for"
msgstr "Afaka tsidiha ny toetr'andro amin'ny faritra"

#: data/org.gnome.Weather.gschema.xml:7
msgid ""
"The locations shown in the world view of gnome-weather. Each value is a "
"GVariant returned by gweather_location_serialize()."
msgstr ""
"Ny faritra hita amin'ny bolantan'ny gnome-weather. Izy ireo dia GVariant "
"returned by gweather_location_serialize()."

#: data/org.gnome.Weather.gschema.xml:14
msgid "The width of the main window."
msgstr "Ny antsakan'ny varavan-kely."

#: data/org.gnome.Weather.gschema.xml:18
msgid "The height of the main window."
msgstr "Ny andavan'ny varavaran-kely."

#: data/org.gnome.Weather.gschema.xml:22
msgid "Window maximized"
msgstr "Varavaran-kely farany ngeza"

#: data/org.gnome.Weather.gschema.xml:23
msgid "Whether or not the window is maximized."
msgstr "Mariho raha efa farany ngeza ny varavaran-kely."

#: data/org.gnome.Weather.metainfo.xml.in.in:10
msgid ""
"A small application that allows you to monitor the current weather "
"conditions for your city, or anywhere in the world."
msgstr ""
"Fampiharana kely afahanao mijery ny toetr'andro amin'izao fotoana amin'ny "
"faritra misy anao, na amin'ny toeran-kafa n'aiza n'aiza maneran-tany."

#: data/org.gnome.Weather.metainfo.xml.in.in:14
msgid ""
"It provides access to detailed forecasts, up to 7 days, with hourly details "
"for the current and next day, using various internet services."
msgstr ""
"Izay ahita antsipirian'ny vina ho mety ny toetran'ny andro, hatramin'ny 7 "
"andro, miarak'amin'ny ora amin'ny fotoana amin'izao sy ny ampitso, amin'ny "
"fampiasana antontak'asa ainterinety samihafa."

#: data/org.gnome.Weather.metainfo.xml.in.in:18
msgid ""
"It also optionally integrates with the GNOME Shell, allowing you to see the "
"current conditions of the most recently searched cities by just typing the "
"name in the Activities Overview."
msgstr ""
"Izy koa afaka atsofoka miaraka amin'ny GNOME Shell, afahanao manaraka "
"nytahany amizao amin'ny tanàna notadiavina vao tsy ela amin'ny fampotsirina "
"nyanarana eo amin'ny Hetsika Hehetra."

